  "scene": {
    "id": "distribute-pilot4",
    "language": "All right, so in this situation, I need to decide who on my team I'm going to pass the ball to. [0][1]Right now, if I'm in this position and the defender is right in the middle of both of the blue, of my blue teammates, then it's probably not a good idea to pass it to either of them in front. So I'm going to choose to pass it off instead to the wingers. [2][3][4]And now my right winger has the ball, and I'm going to move around to support, to act as their support. This way, they could then pass the ball back to me if they want, or they could... If they're free, they could go to a more better position. That is one way we can move around on the field to better position our team.",
